    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Git rebase (range) diff",
      "source_hash": 5135670216316557198,
      "context_hash": 5210397792082928411,
      "translation": "Git rebase (범위) diff",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752365Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub native compare feature shows lots of unrelated changes when a force push changes the base commit of a PR.",
      "source_hash": 16332480994287012053,
      "context_hash": 10394576520523878580,
      "translation": "강제 푸시가 PR의 베이스 커밋을 변경하면 GitHub 자체 비교 기능에는 관련 없는 변경 사항이 대량으로 표시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This handler posts a comment after such a scenario, which links to triagebot `range-diff` feature.",
      "source_hash": 10215399513317531275,
      "context_hash": 11667922436978460862,
      "translation": "이 핸들러는 그러한 상황이 발생한 후 triagebot의 `range-diff` 기능으로 연결되는 댓글을 게시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:06.969358Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 15532329858920482333,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] This feature is [enabled by default](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) in the rust-lang organization.",
      "source_hash": 17648849861768685535,
      "context_hash": 16514694937691144873,
      "translation": "[!NOTE] 이 기능은 rust-lang 조직에서 [기본적으로 활성화](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml)되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:06.969359Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a empty `[range-diff]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 11711266709389067619,
      "context_hash": 16350416313278808876,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 빈 `[range-diff]` 테이블을 두면 해당 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "There are optional keys that you can include:",
      "source_hash": 18282357660506558495,
      "context_hash": 6703999593930152190,
      "translation": "포함할 수 있는 선택적 키는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`consider-push-from-bots` (default: `false`) --- Should push from bots be consider for a range-diff comment.",
      "source_hash": 2013078306472562790,
      "context_hash": 15404400417554188948,
      "translation": "`consider-push-from-bots` (기본값: `false`) --- 봇의 푸시를 range-diff 코멘트 대상으로 고려할지 여부입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 12310813413470454201,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:58.752367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/check_commits/range_diff.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/force_push_range_diff.rs).",
      "source_hash": 5474225215223153917,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/check_commits/range_diff.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/force_push_range_diff.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
